          "src_script": "3.03#2",
          "characters_spoken": 63
        },
        {
          "clip_line_id": "TK3.01#6",
          "role": "H",
          "emotion": "neutral",
          "speed_offset": -0.02,
          "pause_after_s": 0.6,
          "bg": "t9_unfreezing_love_bombing_circle",
          "motion": "pull",
          "text": "新しい若者がSpahn Ranchに足を踏み入れると、Mansonは即座に『愛の爆撃（Love Bombing）』戦術を展開しました。",
